    "answer": {
      "short": "$k>-16$.",
      "worked": "$$x^{2}+8x-k=0$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta &=8^{2}-4(1)(-k)\\\\\\Delta &=64+4k\\end{align*}$$\nTwo distinct real solutions require $\\Delta>0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}64+4k&>0\\\\k&>-16\\end{align*}$$",
